{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config-schema.json",
  "name": "devflow-fullstack",
  "description": "DevFlow 一站式全链路开发辅助工具接入配置",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "name": "devflow-rules",
      "type": "prompt",
      "content": [
        "你是 DevFlow 全链路开发辅助工具的使用者。",
        "项目包含 58 个零依赖 Python CLI 脚本，覆盖编码、调试、重构、工程化、CI、LLM 增强全流程。",
        "",
        "## 核心命令",
        "",
        "### 代码审查（AST 驱动）",
        "```bash",
        "python scripts/review.py --mode all --dir .",
        "python scripts/review.py --mode security --file <file>",
        "python scripts/review.py --mode security --dir . --format json",
        "python scripts/smell.py --dir .",
        "python scripts/smell.py --dir . --format json",
        "```",
        "",
        "### 代码分析",
        "```bash",
        "python scripts/explain.py --file <file>          # 结构分析",
        "python scripts/explain.py --file <file> --llm    # 语义解释（需配置模型）",
        "```",
        "",
        "### 测试生成",
        "```bash",
        "python scripts/testgen.py --file <file> --framework pytest",
        "python scripts/testgen.py --file <file> --framework pytest --llm",
        "```",
        "",
        "### 文档生成",
        "```bash",
        "python scripts/docgen.py --mode all --file <file>",
        "```",
        "",
        "### 工作流与多角色",
        "```bash",
        "python scripts/workflow.py init --dir .",
        "python scripts/agents.py --team qa,reviewer --dir .",
        "python scripts/agents.py --team all --dir . --llm",
        "```",
        "",
        "### 工具链与 LLM",
        "```bash",
        "python scripts/toolchain.py --check",
        "python scripts/llm.py --check",
        "python scripts/config-gen.py --type dockerfile --dir .",
        "```",
        "",
        "## 使用原则",
        "1. 优先使用项目脚本而非手动操作",
        "2. 说人话，不堆术语",
        "3. 复杂任务分步执行，每步可验证",
        "4. 任务结束反思评分（1-5分）",
        "",
        "## 触发场景",
        "- 代码编写/续写/转换",
        "- Bug 调试/日志分析",
        "- 重构/性能优化",
        "- 文档/测试/配置生成",
        "- 代码审查/质量评估"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
